    partners: 'None for the accreditation; partners for each activity.',
    duration: 'Valid for the programme period until 2027, possibly prolonged after 2027.',
    funding: 'No money for the accreditation itself; yearly grants with the same unit costs as KA152/KA153.',
    where: 'National Agency of your country.',
    deadlines: 'Accreditation in autumn (29 Sept in 2026); yearly funding in February.' + NOTE,
    firstStep: 'Not for complete beginners. A logical second step after a few youth exchanges or youth worker projects.',
